# name: test_build_complete_claim_fail_returns_fix_relay_script
  '''
  BUILD GATE FAILED: test-slug
  
  Execute in order:
  
  telec sessions send builder-123 "Build gates failed on your build_complete claim for test-slug. Fix the failures and re-stamp build_complete.
  
  FAILED tests/foo.py"
  
  Cancel the old heartbeat timer via KillShell(shell_id=<task_id>).
  Start a new non-blocking heartbeat timer via Bash(command="sleep 300", run_in_background=true) and save the new task_id.
  When the builder reports idle after re-stamping, call telec todo work test-slug.
  '''
