  '''
  ERROR: REVIEW_ROUND_LIMIT
  Review rounds exceeded for test-slug: current=99, max=3. Per lifecycle/work/review severity schema and general/procedure/orchestration Review Round Limit Handling: round limit is not an escape hatch. The schema has three tiers (Requirement-Violation, Critical, Important) and every tier blocks the verdict. Approve is permitted only when every finding is resolved. If any finding remains, keep review=changes_requested; if the loop is genuinely stuck, escalate to the human with the accumulated findings. Read review-findings and verify.
  
  NEXT: telec todo artifacts read test-slug review-findings
  '''
